Students — especially high schoolers — often lack awareness about research opportunities, creating an information gap between them and the research community. Researchers also struggle to reach younger audiences efficiently.

Create a service that spreads awareness about research opportunities and bridges the information gap between students and researchers at every level.

73% · AWARENESS GAP

Of surveyed college students were unaware of research opportunities available to them in high school.

5 · STAKEHOLDER INTERVIEWS

Identified 4 core barriers: awareness, resources, platform access, and time — across researchers and students.

Personalized research event recommendations based on student interests and university affiliations — filterable by field and time commitment.

Researchers use an AI helper to draft and publish events in minutes — reducing the friction of outreach for time-constrained faculty.

Students follow labs and researchers directly — building ongoing relationships beyond single events and enabling long-term engagement.

Completion badges and follow-up surveys surface student engagement data for institutions — making ROI visible for continued investment.

Thrive

https://dhruvi0805.github.io/final_portfolio/pages/work-thrive.html

Many plant owners struggle with keeping their plants alive due to a lack of awareness of specific care requirements for different species or misdiagnosed issues — leading to frustration, wasted time, and low satisfaction.

Create a solution to reduce diagnosis time and improve user adherence to a plant care schedule through intelligent guidance and reminders.

Research was conducted through in-depth interviews with plant owners and contextual observation of plant care routines at home — combined with secondary literature on common care failures.

Add and organize plants with species-specific care profiles — full history and environment recommendations in one place.

Real-time photo scan identifies plant diseases and delivers treatment recommendations — with direct links to purchase solutions in the integrated storefront.

Personalized watering, fertilizing, and care task lists with smart reminders — weekly progress view keeps users consistent.

Curated care guides and tips organized by plant type — discoverable browsing for new and experienced plant owners.
